{
"id": 1,
"name": "Sweet Beginning",
"category": "Sweet",
"icon": "💕",
"preview": "#ffd6e8",
"theme": "pink",
"text": "Dear {name},\n\nThere is something I have wanted to tell you for a while. Somehow, you have become one of the most special people in my life. The little conversations, the smiles, and the simple moments we share mean more to me than you probably realize.\n\nFor the past {years}, my feelings have continued to grow. I don't know exactly when it happened, but somewhere along the way, you became someone I look forward to seeing and talking to every day.\n\nI don't want to keep these feelings hidden anymore. I simply want to be honest with you and tell you how much you mean to me.\n\nWould you give me a chance to create something beautiful together?\n\nWith love,\n{yourName} ❤️"
},
{
"id": 2,
"name": "From My Heart",
"category": "Heartfelt",
"icon": "❤️",
"preview": "#ffc1d9",
"theme": "rose",
"text": "Dear {name},\n\nSometimes words are difficult when the feeling behind them is so big. Still, today I want to try.\n\nFor {years}, you have slowly become a beautiful part of my thoughts and memories. Your presence has a way of making ordinary days feel a little more meaningful.\n\nI admire the person you are, and I treasure every little moment that has brought us closer. I don't expect a perfect story. I only hope for a chance to begin one.\n\nSo here I am, being completely honest with you: I care about you deeply, and I would love to know if you feel something similar.\n\nAlways,\n{yourName} 💖"
},
{
"id": 3,
"name": "Little Secret",
"category": "Cute",
"icon": "🤫",
"preview": "#ffe0ec",
"theme": "pink",
"text": "Hey {name},\n\nI have a little secret that probably isn't much of a secret anymore.\n\nFor {years}, I have found myself smiling whenever your name appears, remembering little things you said, and looking forward to the moments when we get to talk.\n\nMaybe I should have said this earlier, but I wanted to find the right moment. And maybe this is that moment.\n\nThe truth is simple: I really, really like you.\n\nI don't know where this story could go, but I would love to find out together.\n\nFrom,\n{yourName} 💕"
},
{
"id": 4,
"name": "A Beautiful Memory",
"category": "Memories",
"icon": "🌸",
"preview": "#ffe8f0",
"theme": "peach",
"text": "Dear {name},\n\nWhen I think about the memories I have collected over the years, some moments stand out more than others. Somehow, so many of my favorite memories have you somewhere inside them.\n\nFor {years}, getting to know you has made ordinary moments feel special. A simple conversation can become something I remember for the rest of the day.\n\nThat is what makes you different. You don't have to do anything extraordinary to make a moment meaningful.\n\nI hope we can create many more memories together.\n\nWould you like to begin that next chapter with me?\n\n{yourName} 🌷"
},
{
"id": 5,
"name": "Dreamy Confession",
"category": "Dreamy",
"icon": "🌙",
"preview": "#ddd0ff",
"theme": "lavender",
"text": "Dear {name},\n\nSometimes I imagine all the little possibilities that life can bring. Among all those possibilities, there is one I keep coming back to: the possibility of having you beside me.\n\nFor {years}, my feelings have quietly grown. What started as a small feeling became something I could no longer ignore.\n\nYou have become a beautiful thought that appears in the middle of ordinary days and a reason for many unexpected smiles.\n\nI don't know what tomorrow holds, but I know what I hope for.\n\nI hope there is a tomorrow where we get to create something meaningful together.\n\nWith hope,\n{yourName} ✨"
},
{
"id": 6,
"name": "Forever Smile",
"category": "Cute",
"icon": "😊",
"preview": "#fff0b8",
"theme": "gold",
"text": "Dear {name},\n\nYou have a talent for making me smile without even trying.\n\nFor {years}, there have been countless little moments when simply seeing you or talking to you has made my day better.\n\nI don't need some huge dramatic reason to care about you. Sometimes the smallest things are the reasons someone becomes important.\n\nYour smile, your personality, and the way you make ordinary moments memorable are all things I appreciate about you.\n\nSo here is my simple question: would you let me be someone who gets to make you smile too?\n\n{yourName} 😊❤️"
},
{
"id": 7,
"name": "Moonlight Letter",
"category": "Poetic",
"icon": "🌙",
"preview": "#b9b0ff",
"theme": "purple",
"text": "Dear {name},\n\nIf feelings were stars, I think the sky would be full of them by now.\n\nFor {years}, little by little, you have become one of the brightest thoughts in my mind. Like a quiet light during an ordinary night, you have a way of making everything feel a little warmer.\n\nI don't need a perfect moment or a perfect sentence. I only need the courage to tell you what my heart already knows.\n\nYou are special to me.\n\nAnd if you are willing, I would love to see where our story could lead.\n\nUnder the same moon,\n{yourName} 🌙❤️"
},
{
"id": 8,
"name": "The Honest One",
"category": "Honest",
"icon": "💌",
"preview": "#ffd1dc",
"theme": "rose",
"text": "Dear {name},\n\nI am going to keep this simple because sometimes honesty is better than trying to find perfect words.\n\nI like you. I care about you. And over {years}, those feelings have become stronger than I expected.\n\nYou have become someone I genuinely appreciate having in my life. I value our conversations, our memories, and every little moment we share.\n\nI don't know what your answer will be, and I don't want to put pressure on you. I simply wanted you to know how I feel.\n\nWhatever happens, I'm grateful that I got the courage to tell you.\n\n{yourName} ❤️"
},
{
"id": 9,
"name": "My Favorite Person",
"category": "Sweet",
"icon": "🥰",
"preview": "#ffe2ed",
"theme": "pink",
"text": "Dear {name},\n\nSome people enter our lives and somehow become impossible not to notice.\n\nYou became that person for me.\n\nFor {years}, I have watched our little moments turn into memories that I genuinely treasure. Somewhere along the way, you became one of my favorite people to talk to, think about, and spend time with.\n\nI hope you know how much your presence can brighten someone's day.\n\nFor me, that someone is you.\n\nWould you let me be part of more of your story?\n\n{yourName} 💕"
},
{
"id": 10,
"name": "One Simple Question",
"category": "Simple",
"icon": "❓",
"preview": "#ffd6d6",
"theme": "red",
"text": "Dear {name},\n\nI could write a hundred paragraphs, but everything eventually comes down to one simple feeling.\n\nFor {years}, I have cared about you more and more. You have become someone I truly value, and I don't want to keep pretending that my feelings are just a passing thought.\n\nYou make my days brighter in ways you probably don't realize.\n\nSo after all these words, there is only one thing left to ask.\n\nWould you give me a chance?\n\nWith hope,\n{yourName} ❤️"
},
{
"id": 11,
"name": "Sunshine",
"category": "Happy",
"icon": "☀️",
"preview": "#ffe7a3",
"theme": "gold",
"text": "Dear {name},\n\nSome people feel like sunshine. They make a normal day brighter simply by being there.\n\nYou are that kind of person to me.\n\nFor {years}, your presence has brought countless little moments of happiness into my life. A conversation with you can change my mood, and a simple smile from you can stay in my thoughts for hours.\n\nI hope one day I can return even a little of the happiness you have given me.\n\nMaybe that can be the beginning of something beautiful.\n\n{yourName} ☀️💕"
},
{
"id": 12,
"name": "Rainy Day Feelings",
"category": "Soft",
"icon": "🌧️",
"preview": "#cce8ff",
"theme": "blue",
"text": "Dear {name},\n\nThere are some feelings that arrive quietly, like rain against a window. You don't notice the first few drops, and then suddenly everything is covered in them.\n\nThat is how my feelings for you grew.\n\nOver {years}, little moments slowly became something much bigger. Your kindness, your smile, and the way you make conversations feel easy have all stayed with me.\n\nI don't know what the future will bring, but I would love to discover it one step at a time with you.\n\nFrom my heart,\n{yourName} 💙"
},
{
"id": 13,
"name": "Tiny Moments",
"category": "Memories",
"icon": "✨",
"preview": "#f4dcff",
"theme": "lavender",
"text": "Dear {name},\n\nIt is funny how the smallest moments can become the memories we treasure most.\n\nA short conversation. A shared laugh. A simple hello. A moment that seemed ordinary at the time.\n\nFor {years}, those little moments with you have slowly become some of my favorite memories.\n\nThey made me realize that I don't need something huge to know that someone matters to me.\n\nYou matter to me.\n\nAnd I would love the chance to create many more tiny moments together.\n\n{yourName} ✨"
},
{
"id": 14,
"name": "My Favorite Chapter",
"category": "Story",
"icon": "📖",
"preview": "#ffe4d6",
"theme": "peach",
"text": "Dear {name},\n\nIf my life were a book, there would be many chapters I could talk about. But somehow, the chapters that include you are the ones I remember most clearly.\n\nFor {years}, our story has slowly developed through conversations, memories, and little moments.\n\nI don't know what the next chapter should say. Maybe that is the exciting part.\n\nI would love to turn the page and discover it together.\n\nSo, {name}, would you like to be part of my next chapter?\n\nWith love,\n{yourName} 📖❤️"
},
{
