"category": "Emotional",
"icon": "🌷",
"preview": "#ffe0e8",
"theme": "rose",
"text": "Dear {name},\n\nNot every feeling arrives loudly. Some feelings grow quietly, little by little, until you finally realize how important someone has become.\n\nThat happened to me with you.\n\nFor {years}, I have watched my feelings grow through ordinary moments and unexpected memories.\n\nI didn't plan for it. I didn't expect it. But I am grateful for it.\n\nYou have become someone I genuinely care about, and I wanted you to know.\n\nMaybe our quiet beginning can become something beautiful.\n\n{yourName} 🌷"
},
{
"id": 16,
