"category": "Cute",
"icon": "😁",
"preview": "#ffe8b6",
"theme": "gold",
"text": "Dear {name},\n\nI think your smile deserves its own paragraph.\n\nThere is something about seeing you smile that makes everything feel lighter. For {years}, I have noticed how easily you can turn an ordinary moment into a good one.\n\nMaybe you don't realize how much that means.\n\nI hope I can become someone who gives you reasons to smile too.\n\nI care about you more than I can fit into one little letter, but I hope these words are enough to help you understand.\n\nWould you let me try?\n\n{yourName} 😊❤️"
},
{
"id": 17,
"name": "A Thousand Thoughts",
"category": "Deep",
"icon": "💭",
"preview": "#e1d4ff",
"theme": "purple",
"text": "Dear {name},\n\nThere are probably a thousand thoughts I could write here, but they all seem to lead back to the same person: you.\n\nFor {years}, you have appeared in my thoughts during the most random moments. A song, a place, a joke, or even something completely ordinary can remind me of you.\n\nThat is when I realized you are not just a passing thought anymore. You have become a meaningful part of my life.\n\nI hope I can become a meaningful part of yours too.\n\nWith all my thoughts,\n{yourName} 💭💕"
},
{
