"category": "Romantic",
"icon": "🌹",
"preview": "#ffd0d8",
"theme": "red",
"text": "Dear {name},\n\nIf I could choose one person to share more memories, conversations, laughs, and ordinary days with, I already know who I would choose.\n\nYou.\n\nFor {years}, you have become someone incredibly special to me. I appreciate the person you are and the happiness you bring into my life.\n\nI don't need a perfect future. I just want a chance to build something genuine, one moment at a time.\n\nIf you are willing, I would love for that person to be you.\n\n{yourName} 🌹"
},
