"text": "Dear {name},\n\nIf every star represented one reason I appreciate you, I think the night sky would never be big enough.\n\nFor {years}, my feelings have grown quietly but steadily. You have become one of those rare people whose presence can make an ordinary day feel special.\n\nI don't know what our future looks like, but I know I would like the chance to discover it.\n\nMaybe our story can become one of those memories we look back on and smile about.\n\nUntil then, know that you are incredibly special to me.\n\n{yourName} ⭐❤️"
},
