"icon": "📚",
"preview": "#e5d8ff",
"theme": "lavender",
"text": "Dear {name},\n\nEvery great story starts with a beginning, but nobody knows exactly where it will end.\n\nMaybe that is what makes stories exciting.\n\nFor {years}, I have been lucky enough to have you as part of my life. Now I find myself wondering what could happen if we chose to create more memories together.\n\nMaybe there could be new places, new jokes, new adventures, and countless ordinary days that become special simply because we shared them.\n\nWould you like to see what our next chapter could become?\n\n{yourName} 📚❤️"
