"icon": "☕",
"preview": "#f5d7c0",
"theme": "peach",
"text": "Dear {name},\n\nSome feelings remind me of a warm cup of coffee on a quiet day. They are comforting, familiar, and somehow make everything feel better.\n\nThat is how I feel when I think about you.\n\nFor {years}, you have become someone whose presence feels genuinely special to me.\n\nI would love more conversations, more laughs, and more simple moments with you.\n\nMaybe we could create our own collection of cozy little memories.\n\nWhat do you think?\n\n{yourName} ☕💕"
},
