"text": "Dear {name},\n\nIf I could keep every memory that made me smile, I know many of them would have something to do with you.\n\nFor {years}, you have been part of moments that I will always remember fondly.\n\nSometimes I wish I could pause those moments and keep them forever.\n\nBut maybe the better idea is to create more.\n\nMore conversations. More laughs. More adventures. More memories that we can look back on someday.\n\nI would love that.\n\n{yourName} 📷❤️"
