{
"id": 34,
"name": "The Long Letter",
"category": "Long",
"icon": "💌",
"preview": "#ffd4e5",
"theme": "pink",
"text": "Dear {name},\n\nI wanted to write something that could properly explain what you mean to me, even though I know words can never completely capture a feeling.\n\nOver {years}, you have become someone I genuinely appreciate. There are so many little things about you that I admire, from the way you make people feel comfortable to the way you can turn an ordinary moment into something memorable.\n\nI treasure the conversations we have had and the memories we have created. I also find myself hoping for more moments like those in the future.\n\nI don't know what happens next, and I don't want to pretend that I do. But I do know that I would be happy if the next part of my story included more of you.\n\nThank you for simply being yourself.\n\nWith all my heart,\n{yourName} ❤️"
},
{
"id": 35,
