"category": "Simple",
"icon": "🌻",
"preview": "#fff2a8",
"theme": "gold",
"text": "Dear {name},\n\nHappiness doesn't always need to be something huge.\n\nSometimes happiness is a good conversation, a shared laugh, a familiar smile, or simply knowing someone special is nearby.\n\nFor {years}, you have been one of those little sources of happiness in my life.\n\nI hope we can create many more simple, happy moments together.\n\nThat is all I really want: something genuine, comfortable, and full of good memories.\n\nWould you like that too?\n\n{yourName} 🌻💕"
},
