"text": "Dear {name},\n\nImagine that this letter could show you exactly what is in my heart.\n\nYou would see every little memory, every smile, every conversation, and every moment that made me realize how much I care about you.\n\nFor {years}, those moments have slowly filled my heart with feelings I can no longer hide.\n\nSo instead of keeping them there, I am putting them on paper.\n\nYou are important to me. You are special to me. And I would love the chance to become someone special to you too.\n\nWith my heart on paper,\n{yourName} 💗"
