"text": "Dear {name},\n\nIf feelings were music, I think mine for you would be a song that slowly became louder over time.\n\nFor {years}, every memory has added another note. Every conversation has added another melody. And somewhere along the way, the whole thing became impossible to ignore.\n\nI may not know the perfect words, but I know the feeling.\n\nYou make my world a little brighter, and I would love to know if we could create our own beautiful rhythm together.\n\nWith a song in my heart,\n{yourName} 🎵💕"
